      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is hard to provide an approximation for the number of unnecessary SK_UNSAFE_TODOs after the rewrite project. From my understanding, the std::array conversion is almost done, so many of these SK_UNSAFE_TODOs for C-style arrays either weren\u0027t approved due to performance issues or weren\u0027t detected by the rewrite tool. It is also hard to give an estimate for the instances of pointer subscripts that should be handled by the spanification tool.",
