      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is really no conflict at all between this project and the rewrite project.\n\nIt makes things easier, because when we enforce the -Wunsafe-buffer-usage check, it prevents the number of unsafe patterns from increasing. If we wait for the rewrite tool, the number of instances may increase in the meantime while the file suppressions are deleted and the SK_UNSAFE_TODOs are merged into the codebase.",
